sequenceDiagram
    actor Reader
    participant UI as ReservationUI
    participant Service as ReservationService
    participant Reservation

    Note over Reader,UI: Precondition: Reader is registered

    Reader->>UI: submitReservation(copyId)
    activate UI

    UI->>Service: createReservation(readerId, copyId)
    activate Service

    Service->>Service: validateReservationRequest(readerId, copyId)

    Service->>Reservation: findActiveReservation(copyId)
    activate Reservation
    Reservation-->>Service: activeReservationExists
    deactivate Reservation

    break Active reservation exists
    Service-->>UI: rejectReservation()
    UI-->>Reader: displayAlreadyReservedMessage()
    end

    deactivate Service
    deactivate UI